### Define and Use a Custom Faker Provider

Source: https://context7.com/fakerphp/faker/llms.txt

Create a custom provider class extending Faker's Base provider and register it with a Faker instance to generate custom data like products, departments, employee IDs, and project codes.

```php
<?php

namespace App\Faker;

use Faker\Provider\Base;

class CustomProvider extends Base
{
    protected static $products = ['Widget', 'Gadget', 'Gizmo', 'Doohickey'];
    protected static $departments = ['Engineering', 'Sales', 'Marketing', 'HR'];

    public function product()
    {
        return static::randomElement(static::$products);
    }

    public function department()
    {
        return static::randomElement(static::$departments);
    }

    public function employeeId()
    {
        return $this->generator->numerify('EMP-####');
    }

    public function projectCode()
    {
        return $this->generator->bothify('??-####');
    }
}

// Usage
$faker = Faker\Factory::create();
$faker->addProvider(new \App\Faker\CustomProvider($faker));

echo $faker->product();      // 'Gadget'
echo $faker->department();   // 'Engineering'
echo $faker->employeeId();   // 'EMP-4521'
echo $faker->projectCode();  // 'AB-1234'
```

--------------------------------

### Initialize Faker Generator

Source: https://context7.com/fakerphp/faker/llms.txt

Create a Faker generator instance using the Factory. Supports default locale, specific locales, and seeding for reproducible results.

```php
<?php

require_once 'vendor/autoload.php';

// Create a generator with default locale (en_US)
$faker = Faker\Factory::create();

// Create a generator with specific locale
$faker = Faker\Factory::create('fr_FR');    // French
$faker = Faker\Factory::create('de_DE');    // German
$faker = Faker\Factory::create('ja_JP');    // Japanese

// Seed the generator for reproducible results
$faker->seed(1234);

// Generate reproducible data
echo $faker->name();  // Always returns the same name with this seed
// 'Dr. Zane Stroman'

// Reset random seed
$faker->seed();  // Uses random seed again
```

### Custom Provider Creation

Source: https://context7.com/fakerphp/faker/llms.txt

Extend Faker with your own custom data providers by creating a new class that extends the `Base` provider. You can define static properties for data arrays and create public methods to return randomized elements or formatted strings. These custom providers can then be added to a Faker generator instance.

