### Select a version

Use an exact tag from the README's [version table](../README.md#mysql). The default is `mysql-8.4.7`.

```php
$mysqlFaker = \Faker\Factory::create();
$mysql = new \SqlFaker\MySqlProvider($mysqlFaker, 'mysql-8.4.7');
